{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"cuimao-e-o156","title":"梁郡系囚数岁不决，诏书徙狱于司马岐属县，岐言囚情易见不当久系","accounts":[{"id":"cuimao-a-0b75c77eb9470cee5740","label":"正文","text":"梁郡系囚数岁不决，诏书徙狱于司马岐属县，岐言囚情易见不当久系","evidence":["cuimao-q-dc84bf970ce5d3dc3622"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-3df470af405520c680f5","label":"正文","text":"囚至司马岐诘之皆莫敢匿诈，一朝决竟，遂超为廷尉","evidence":["cuimao-q-dafce03ea96c23eb1ba8"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cuimao-p0019","role":"受徙狱而论囚情者；诘囚决狱而超为廷尉者","evidence":["cuimao-q-dc84bf970ce5d3dc3622","cuimao-q-dafce03ea96c23eb1ba8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["cuimao-q-dc84bf970ce5d3dc3622","cuimao-q-dafce03ea96c23eb1ba8"]},"ordering_evidence":"cuimao-q-dc84bf970ce5d3dc3622","source_order":[12,401,24],"order":2843}],"persons":[{"id":"cuimao-p0019","name":"司马岐","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-dafce03ea96c23eb1ba8","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b49c77998858c51fdcb7","layer":"original","quote":"及囚至，诘之，皆莫敢匿诈；一朝决竟〖5〗，遂超为廷尉","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":102,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-dc84bf970ce5d3dc3622","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b49c77998858c51fdcb7","layer":"original","quote":"梁郡有系囚，多所连及，数岁不决。诏书徙狱于岐属县〖2〗，县请预治牢具〖3〗。岐曰：“今囚有数十，既巧诈难符，且已倦楚毒〖4〗；其情易见，岂当复久处囹圄邪","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
